[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 7022.31, "timestamp": "01:57:02", "text": "受了伤，但没有致命伤。出色地，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7023.99, "timestamp": "01:57:03", "text": "我只是皮肤受损，所以可以"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7025.95, "timestamp": "01:57:05", "text": "仍然"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7028.39, "timestamp": "01:57:08", "text": "飞。我们这边有两个人，而且"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7030.589, "timestamp": "01:57:10", "text": "看起来像"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7037.83, "timestamp": "01:57:17", "text": "无论是否在侧面，上面都不止两个。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7039.27, "timestamp": "01:57:19", "text": "他们那边。他们好像有三个或"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7041.109, "timestamp": "01:57:21", "text": "四、"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7047.99, "timestamp": "01:57:27", "text": "实际上，对我来说，这样做会更好。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7051.27, "timestamp": "01:57:31", "text": "因为我有个游戏厅，所以才有土地，对吧？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7054.39, "timestamp": "01:57:34", "text": "是的。在街机厅跑步时也可以当运动员"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7057.91, "timestamp": "01:57:37", "text": "就像子弹一样从你体内射出，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7059.75, "timestamp": "01:57:39", "text": "它会给你一个倒计时，然后重新加载。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7061.189, "timestamp": "01:57:41", "text": "自动地。但如果你玩"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7063.109, "timestamp": "01:57:43", "text": "现实点，你必须降落才能重新装弹。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7074.589, "timestamp": "01:57:54", "text": "就团队整体而言"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7077.109, "timestamp": "01:57:57", "text": "战斗中，我们队表现不太好。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7079.51, "timestamp": "01:57:59", "text": "与敌方队伍相比。而且在"}]